WEBVTT

00:00:09.670 --> 00:00:11.960
Helen-san...?

00:00:26.880 --> 00:00:28.670
Oh my, that's too bad.

00:00:28.670 --> 00:00:30.920
That was your precious recover potion...

00:00:36.130 --> 00:00:37.460
Oh dear...

00:00:37.460 --> 00:00:40.420
I was intending to finish you off
with that just now, but...

00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:44.790
Helen-san... Why?

00:00:48.460 --> 00:00:50.170
Why do something like this?

00:00:50.540 --> 00:00:52.130
Please explain!

00:00:52.670 --> 00:00:54.460
You seem to be in pain...

00:00:54.460 --> 00:00:56.040
But don't worry.

00:00:56.420 --> 00:00:58.790
I'll put you out of your misery right now!

00:02:35.420 --> 00:02:38.000
<b>The Farmer and the Life That Was Saved</b>

00:02:53.040 --> 00:02:54.880
So, you've awakened...

00:02:54.880 --> 00:02:56.540
Benevolent Dragon...

00:02:56.540 --> 00:02:58.080
Mirage!

00:03:00.170 --> 00:03:02.210
"Benevolent Dragon"?

00:03:02.210 --> 00:03:04.040
What's going on?

00:03:04.040 --> 00:03:06.540
Keep your wits about you, boy.

00:03:07.040 --> 00:03:12.000
That girl is currently being possessed by Ouroboros.

00:03:12.000 --> 00:03:13.080
What?!

00:03:17.880 --> 00:03:20.580
Oh, I've been found out already, huh?

00:03:20.750 --> 00:03:26.580
I had wanted to play around for a little bit more,
but you ruined my plans by exposing me!

00:03:26.580 --> 00:03:27.710
Don't be ridiculous!

00:03:27.710 --> 00:03:31.330
You know there is no chance
I would let you have it your way!

00:03:31.750 --> 00:03:35.040
Boy, use my power.

00:03:37.040 --> 00:03:39.420
It's the Power of Regeneration...

00:03:49.630 --> 00:03:50.710
Mirage!

00:03:55.880 --> 00:03:58.790
Give priority to the elderly and the children
and get them inside the castle!

00:03:58.790 --> 00:03:59.630
Yes, ma'am!

00:03:59.630 --> 00:04:02.420
Once you have guided everyone in,
close the castle gates,

00:04:02.420 --> 00:04:05.710
and all of you will take up your positions
in order to intercept Ouroboros!

00:04:05.710 --> 00:04:06.630
Yes, ma'am!

00:04:06.830 --> 00:04:11.250
Even the castle gates and defenses
are far too weak if we face Ouroboros...

00:04:11.750 --> 00:04:14.880
But it's better than doing nothing!

00:04:15.040 --> 00:04:16.130
Al-kun...

00:04:16.960 --> 00:04:19.080
I will defend our land!

00:04:20.250 --> 00:04:21.460
So...

00:04:23.210 --> 00:04:24.290
Mirage!

00:04:24.750 --> 00:04:28.130
This body will not last that long...

00:04:28.130 --> 00:04:31.250
If you can disable its defenses,

00:04:31.250 --> 00:04:34.920
then you can purify him
with the power I granted you...

00:04:35.170 --> 00:04:39.040
If you do that,
then you will be able to save the girl...

00:04:45.830 --> 00:04:49.170
This girl is important to you, isn't she?

00:04:51.080 --> 00:04:53.170
Now then, what will you do?

00:04:56.420 --> 00:04:58.670
How about it, human?

00:04:58.670 --> 00:05:01.460
There is no way you can attack this body-

00:05:14.830 --> 00:05:16.130
You bastard...

00:05:16.790 --> 00:05:18.920
Attacking this girl...

00:05:19.130 --> 00:05:22.330
Helen-san was making an appeal
with the look in her eye.

00:05:22.830 --> 00:05:25.130
Now then, what will you do?

00:05:29.330 --> 00:05:31.630
It's okay, Al-kun...

00:05:32.210 --> 00:05:35.290
Despite the fact that I'm being possessed,

00:05:35.290 --> 00:05:38.210
I don't want to hurt someone
with my own hands...

00:05:38.420 --> 00:05:40.580
So, please!

00:05:40.920 --> 00:05:44.750
Stop me and Ouroboros...
then end all of this!

00:05:44.750 --> 00:05:46.080
Helen-san...

00:05:53.920 --> 00:05:55.380
This is...

00:05:55.670 --> 00:05:57.630
This is what was best, right?

00:05:58.210 --> 00:05:59.380
Helen-san...

00:06:03.000 --> 00:06:04.250
Yes...

00:06:04.880 --> 00:06:07.580
Thank you... Al-kun...

00:06:11.170 --> 00:06:12.460
Are you all right?

00:06:12.920 --> 00:06:14.130
Yes...

00:06:17.420 --> 00:06:18.960
Do not underestimate me...

00:06:18.960 --> 00:06:21.790
you lowly human!

00:06:23.670 --> 00:06:25.000
Boy!

00:06:32.250 --> 00:06:35.080
Victory is mine, Mirage!

00:06:38.420 --> 00:06:42.170
Now with this, I won't let anyone get in my way!

00:06:43.630 --> 00:06:44.790
Wh-what the...?!

00:06:54.750 --> 00:06:57.170
This bastard's mind is...

00:06:57.500 --> 00:06:59.290
There's nothing there...

00:07:01.040 --> 00:07:02.080
No...

00:07:05.210 --> 00:07:07.960
Wh-what the...?!

00:07:08.880 --> 00:07:12.920
He's silently... cultivating the land!

00:07:38.290 --> 00:07:40.170
This bastard's mind...

00:07:40.880 --> 00:07:44.880
There's no way to attack it... at all!

00:07:56.380 --> 00:07:57.750
This can't be...

00:07:57.750 --> 00:08:03.290
Not only did he prevent my possession,
but he was able to repel me.

00:08:03.880 --> 00:08:08.000
It is your loss, Ouroboros!

00:08:10.830 --> 00:08:13.380
This ends now!

00:08:33.710 --> 00:08:35.710
I am grateful...

00:08:36.250 --> 00:08:37.580
Boy...

00:08:57.920 --> 00:08:59.080
Al-kun?

00:09:07.170 --> 00:09:08.000
Al-kun!

00:09:08.000 --> 00:09:09.460
Have you come to?

00:09:09.960 --> 00:09:10.670
This is...

00:09:10.670 --> 00:09:12.290
The clinic at the guild.

00:09:12.290 --> 00:09:14.710
Are you okay? Do you hurt anywhere?

00:09:14.710 --> 00:09:16.960
Yeah. I'm fine.

00:09:17.130 --> 00:09:18.830
Thank goodness!

00:09:19.080 --> 00:09:21.250
I'm sorry for making you worry.

00:09:22.460 --> 00:09:26.040
W-well, I had thought if it was you,
then you'd be okay, but...

00:09:26.330 --> 00:09:28.670
Well, I don't really know about that...

00:09:29.210 --> 00:09:31.250
So then, what about Ouroboros?

00:09:31.420 --> 00:09:35.250
Thanks to you and Mirage, it was safely purified.

00:09:35.630 --> 00:09:37.000
I'm glad...

00:09:37.000 --> 00:09:40.830
It's just that Mirage apparently
used up all of its power,

00:09:40.830 --> 00:09:43.920
so it disappeared with the light after that.

00:09:43.920 --> 00:09:45.080
I see...

00:09:45.080 --> 00:09:46.330
Hang on, Mirage?

00:09:46.330 --> 00:09:48.880
As in that legendary
Benevolent Dragon Mirage?

00:09:49.130 --> 00:09:50.130
Yeah.

00:09:50.130 --> 00:09:54.750
When I was in a tight spot,
it showed itself all of a sudden and assisted me.

00:09:55.790 --> 00:09:57.960
I guess wondrous things can happen too...

00:09:57.960 --> 00:09:59.380
Yeah, really...

00:09:59.960 --> 00:10:05.670
By the way, Helen-san, are you all right now
after being possessed by Ouroboros?

00:10:05.880 --> 00:10:09.170
Me? Yeah, I'm totally fine.

00:10:09.330 --> 00:10:11.000
It's just a little...

00:10:13.920 --> 00:10:15.170
What?!

00:10:15.170 --> 00:10:18.460
It's ended up getting a little interesting, though...

00:10:20.040 --> 00:10:22.170
Th-th-that hand!

00:10:22.170 --> 00:10:24.000
It can't be! Is Ouroboros still-

00:10:24.000 --> 00:10:25.670
Wait! Wait! That's not it!

00:10:25.830 --> 00:10:26.750
Here!

00:10:28.000 --> 00:10:30.170
Look, it's returned back, you see?!

00:10:32.670 --> 00:10:33.580
Look!

00:10:33.580 --> 00:10:34.420
My arms...

00:10:35.170 --> 00:10:36.290
and my legs!

00:10:36.290 --> 00:10:38.920
I can transform them all freely!

00:10:40.420 --> 00:10:41.670
Isn't that convenient?

00:10:41.670 --> 00:10:43.710
Th-that's not the issue...

00:10:43.710 --> 00:10:45.580
When would that be convenient?

00:10:45.580 --> 00:10:50.920
I had some resistance to the fact this power remained,
even though Ouroboros disappeared.

00:10:50.920 --> 00:10:54.880
But I thought this power
that was used in order to kill people,

00:10:54.880 --> 00:10:59.080
can maybe be used to save people from now on.

00:11:01.330 --> 00:11:05.580
And Rai-kun's message
that you passed on to me...

00:11:06.290 --> 00:11:10.130
"I don't regret that I was able to save Big Sis' life."

00:11:10.500 --> 00:11:12.250
"Besides, if she was able to survive,

00:11:12.250 --> 00:11:15.500
then it's her duty to become happy
on everyone's behalf."

00:11:18.170 --> 00:11:23.500
I have to live happily, or there wouldn't have been
meaning in being saved by him...

00:11:25.330 --> 00:11:26.880
That's right.

00:11:29.500 --> 00:11:31.920
There seems to be a good mood
going on here, you know...

00:11:31.920 --> 00:11:33.630
No, it's not like that!

00:11:33.630 --> 00:11:34.670
Oh, is that so?

00:11:34.830 --> 00:11:37.830
That reminds me,
you seem to be with Al-kun a lot.

00:11:37.830 --> 00:11:39.080
You are...?

00:11:39.080 --> 00:11:41.420
Oh, she's called Filia.

00:11:41.630 --> 00:11:44.670
What kind of relationship
does she have with you, Al-kun?

00:11:44.790 --> 00:11:46.250
Relationship?

00:11:46.540 --> 00:11:48.880
Oh... Um...

00:11:48.880 --> 00:11:51.380
Childhood friend! Or something like that.

00:11:51.380 --> 00:11:52.380
Yeah, that's right!

00:11:52.380 --> 00:11:54.920
She's totally a childhood friend...

00:11:55.210 --> 00:11:56.210
Huh...

00:11:56.210 --> 00:11:58.000
A childhood friend, huh?

00:11:58.830 --> 00:12:00.420
Once more, nice to meet you.

00:12:00.750 --> 00:12:02.920
Yes, nice to meet you too.

00:12:05.670 --> 00:12:07.880
Helen! You okay?!

00:12:07.880 --> 00:12:08.960
Helen!

00:12:08.960 --> 00:12:09.830
Hey!

00:12:10.500 --> 00:12:11.580
Helen!

00:12:11.580 --> 00:12:13.000
E-everyone!

00:12:13.000 --> 00:12:13.920
Jeez.

00:12:13.920 --> 00:12:15.790
You know, I did stop them!

00:12:15.790 --> 00:12:19.380
And yet these people wouldn't listen.

00:12:19.540 --> 00:12:21.880
Al! It's good you returned safely!

00:12:21.880 --> 00:12:24.880
So you defeated Ouroboros this time?!

00:12:25.080 --> 00:12:28.250
Well, I guess there wasn't even a need
for me to go lend a hand then...

00:12:28.250 --> 00:12:29.210
What?!

00:12:29.210 --> 00:12:32.960
How are you in any position to say that, Luke,
when you get flustered against even one dwarf?

00:12:32.960 --> 00:12:33.630
What?!

00:12:33.630 --> 00:12:34.580
What?!
What was that?!<b></b>

00:12:34.580 --> 00:12:36.670
Honestly! Be quiet!

00:12:36.670 --> 00:12:38.750
You know it's bad for Al-kun's health!

00:12:38.750 --> 00:12:40.630
I'm fine!

00:12:41.420 --> 00:12:42.380
Look.

00:12:42.380 --> 00:12:43.670
As you can see.

00:12:43.670 --> 00:12:46.080
Whoa! That's so you, Al!

00:12:46.500 --> 00:12:47.380
All right!

00:12:47.380 --> 00:12:49.000
In commemoration of subduing Ouroboros...

00:12:49.000 --> 00:12:51.000
Shall we have a toast?!

00:12:51.000 --> 00:12:52.210
Nice!

00:12:52.210 --> 00:12:53.880
Guild Master's treat!

00:12:53.880 --> 00:12:56.330
What? Wh-why is it my treat?

00:12:56.330 --> 00:12:57.790
Why not?

00:12:57.790 --> 00:13:02.000
An adventurer belonging to our guild
defeated Ouroboros, you know?

00:13:02.210 --> 00:13:05.290
No, no... It wasn't just my power though...

00:13:05.290 --> 00:13:08.920
Surely a bounty will be paid out
by the castle or something?

00:13:08.920 --> 00:13:10.540
Y-you think so?

00:13:10.790 --> 00:13:13.330
It'll be paid out! Like a huge amount!

00:13:13.330 --> 00:13:14.710
Hey! Fil-

00:13:14.710 --> 00:13:15.710
What?!

00:13:19.460 --> 00:13:22.000
It'd be nice if it got paid out in a huge amount...

00:13:22.000 --> 00:13:26.000
Well, whether it'll be paid out or not
will be up to Princess Fal-sama.

00:13:27.080 --> 00:13:30.290
W-well, of course! Yeah, that's right!

00:13:31.830 --> 00:13:33.460
Anyway, let's drink!

00:13:33.460 --> 00:13:35.130
Yeah!

00:13:36.960 --> 00:13:38.330
Cheers!

00:13:38.630 --> 00:13:42.380
To not only a meritorious person,
but a brave adventurer, Al Wayne!

00:13:42.380 --> 00:13:44.000
Cheers!

00:13:44.000 --> 00:13:47.960
And to me, a great guild master! Cheers!

00:13:51.750 --> 00:13:56.710
Now then, eat and drink plenty,
and please do your best again starting tomorrow!

00:13:57.080 --> 00:13:59.750
Since it's the Guild Master's treat,
don't hold back!

00:14:00.080 --> 00:14:01.330
Yeah!

00:14:01.330 --> 00:14:02.630
All in moderation, okay?

00:14:02.630 --> 00:14:03.830
Yeah!

00:14:03.830 --> 00:14:05.420
I mean really, in moderation...

00:14:05.420 --> 00:14:06.750
Yeah!

00:14:07.000 --> 00:14:10.130
Hey, Al! You're the star, so have this!

00:14:10.380 --> 00:14:11.630
That's a no!

00:14:11.630 --> 00:14:14.040
You can't forcibly offer to another person!

00:14:14.380 --> 00:14:16.460
So, Alutchi, what are you drinking?

00:14:16.460 --> 00:14:18.830
Um... Like a lemin soda...

00:14:18.830 --> 00:14:19.540
What?!

00:14:19.540 --> 00:14:21.920
Let's drink alcohol together
instead of a juice like that!

00:14:21.920 --> 00:14:23.540
I said not to hassle him!

00:14:23.540 --> 00:14:24.420
Come on, we're going!

00:14:24.420 --> 00:14:25.380
Ouch, ow...

00:14:25.630 --> 00:14:28.250
I've got to get home before it gets too late...

00:14:28.580 --> 00:14:31.710
Tomorrow, I have the harvesting
of the potatas from the morning, so...

00:14:31.710 --> 00:14:35.040
And you're thinking about
your fields again, aren't you?

00:14:35.210 --> 00:14:39.290
It's okay for you to just have fun
for at least today, you know?

00:14:39.540 --> 00:14:41.250
Well, I guess so.

00:14:41.250 --> 00:14:43.630
Thank you very much for your hard work...

00:14:44.250 --> 00:14:48.170
I knew my confidence in you wasn't misplaced!

00:14:48.460 --> 00:14:50.830
It makes me happy for you to say that.

00:14:51.330 --> 00:14:56.710
You know, when I was standing above the castle walls
preparing to intercept Ouroboros,

00:14:56.880 --> 00:15:00.250
I knew someone like me was no match for it, but...

00:15:01.080 --> 00:15:04.880
But when I thought about how hard
you must have been fighting,

00:15:04.880 --> 00:15:09.000
it motivated me to put everything
that I had into defending our land.

00:15:09.540 --> 00:15:10.630
I see...

00:15:10.880 --> 00:15:12.380
Amazing!

00:15:12.830 --> 00:15:14.000
Right, on!

00:15:14.830 --> 00:15:16.040
Left, on!

00:15:16.830 --> 00:15:18.170
Right leg, on!

00:15:19.000 --> 00:15:21.580
Right, on! Left, on!
Right leg, off! Right, on! Left, on!

00:15:21.580 --> 00:15:24.130
Hey, come on. You're being rude to Helen...
Right leg, on! Right, off! Left, on! Right leg, on!<b></b>

00:15:24.130 --> 00:15:25.670
Yay!

00:15:26.500 --> 00:15:28.380
Come on, Al-tan! Let's drink more!

00:15:28.380 --> 00:15:29.290
Luke-san, you've had too much...

00:15:29.290 --> 00:15:30.670
Luke, you're a bad drunk!
Luke-san, you've had too much...<b></b>

00:15:30.670 --> 00:15:31.460
Right, on! Left, off!

00:15:31.460 --> 00:15:32.960
Helen! You're overdoing it!
Right, on! Left, off!<b></b>

00:15:32.960 --> 00:15:34.380
In my younger days-

00:15:34.380 --> 00:15:35.670
Ancient history!

00:15:37.880 --> 00:15:39.380
I feel bad, Testa.

00:15:39.380 --> 00:15:41.580
Having you help me out
from the morning and all.

00:15:41.580 --> 00:15:43.380
Oh please, don't worry about it.

00:15:43.630 --> 00:15:46.540
It was fun being able to help you out
for the first time in a while.

00:15:46.540 --> 00:15:47.630
I see...

00:15:47.920 --> 00:15:49.170
But you know,

00:15:49.170 --> 00:15:54.130
isn't it tough to be holding onto fields in the royal capital
AND in the village of Sils at the same time?

00:15:54.290 --> 00:15:55.830
Oh, not at all.

00:15:55.830 --> 00:15:59.580
You see, I'm the happiest when I'm gardening.

00:15:59.960 --> 00:16:02.130
I've never thought it was tough.

00:16:02.130 --> 00:16:05.960
As expected of a foremost first-rate farmer.
You defy convention.

00:16:05.960 --> 00:16:07.580
Don't make fun of me.

00:16:10.080 --> 00:16:11.790
Letter for Al-san!

00:16:11.790 --> 00:16:13.380
Thank you, Reaks.

00:16:13.630 --> 00:16:17.540
All things considered, it's amazing
you knew I'd be over here today.

00:16:17.540 --> 00:16:18.630
That's because...

00:16:19.040 --> 00:16:21.170
I am a "pro."

00:16:21.830 --> 00:16:23.170
I see...

00:16:23.170 --> 00:16:24.920
He's not an ordinary fellow...

00:16:25.420 --> 00:16:28.250
Anyway, is that another love letter?
From Lucica-san?

00:16:28.250 --> 00:16:29.170
Probably.

00:16:29.420 --> 00:16:31.540
No... It's from my dad.

00:16:31.830 --> 00:16:33.170
Is it urgent business?

00:16:35.670 --> 00:16:36.460
"Dear Al.

00:16:36.460 --> 00:16:40.420
Are you doing well? Your mom and I are well.

00:16:40.420 --> 00:16:43.750
By the way, I hear that you
moved to the royal capital.

00:16:43.750 --> 00:16:47.250
Even though when we moved
and invited you to come with us,

00:16:47.250 --> 00:16:50.080
you declined and said you were
going to become a farmer...

00:16:50.380 --> 00:16:52.460
What kind of change of heart is that?

00:16:52.460 --> 00:16:55.170
Could it be that you got a girlfriend now?"

00:16:56.580 --> 00:16:58.250
"Well, setting that aside...

00:16:58.250 --> 00:16:59.830
let me get straight to the point.

00:17:00.130 --> 00:17:01.750
Will you come visit us?

00:17:01.750 --> 00:17:03.880
I've included some money with the letter.

00:17:03.880 --> 00:17:07.080
Please use it to find a ride and come see us.

00:17:07.580 --> 00:17:08.460
So, he says...

00:17:08.790 --> 00:17:10.750
They're probably missing you, you know?

00:17:10.750 --> 00:17:12.710
How long has it been since you last saw them?

00:17:12.880 --> 00:17:14.290
Um...

00:17:14.290 --> 00:17:15.130
See?

00:17:15.130 --> 00:17:17.710
You've seen them so little
you have to think about it.

00:17:17.710 --> 00:17:19.670
You should go see them once in a while.

00:17:21.380 --> 00:17:23.460
I do have the quests from the guild too...

00:17:24.210 --> 00:17:27.540
I guess I'll try going
once I finish the quests I took on...

00:17:28.330 --> 00:17:30.210
Freshly picked! Freshly picked!

00:17:30.380 --> 00:17:32.500
They're sweet and tasty tomatas!

00:17:32.500 --> 00:17:34.960
They're incredibly delicious!
Superb tomatas!

00:17:34.960 --> 00:17:35.960
I'd like one, please!
Toma, toma, toma!<b></b>

00:17:35.960 --> 00:17:36.380
Toma, toma, toma!

00:17:36.380 --> 00:17:38.710
Okay, mister. That'll be 140 nell.

00:17:40.960 --> 00:17:41.960
Color: good!

00:17:41.960 --> 00:17:43.290
Shape: good!

00:17:43.290 --> 00:17:45.000
Mister, are you okay?

00:17:48.080 --> 00:17:50.040
Yum! It's too good!

00:17:50.040 --> 00:17:53.250
The sweetness, the sourness,
the freshness is beyond extraordinary!

00:17:53.460 --> 00:17:54.630
Shopkeeper! Shopkeeper!

00:17:54.630 --> 00:17:56.170
Please tell me,
where was this tomata produced?!

00:17:56.170 --> 00:17:56.960
Wh-what?!

00:17:57.130 --> 00:18:01.420
Not only is it super abundant in the nutrients
of lycopene, beta-carotene, and vitamin C,

00:18:01.420 --> 00:18:03.790
the harmony of the sweetness
and the acidity is superb!

00:18:03.790 --> 00:18:05.790
I want to know the cultivation method!

00:18:05.790 --> 00:18:07.000
Please tell me!

00:18:07.000 --> 00:18:09.080
Where is it from? Who produced it?
C'mon, c'mon, c'mon!

00:18:09.330 --> 00:18:11.580
M-mister. Who the hell are you?

00:18:11.580 --> 00:18:12.790
I'm a farmer!

00:18:13.250 --> 00:18:15.830
I want to make this kind of tasty tomata too!

00:18:15.830 --> 00:18:17.830
I-I see...

00:18:18.040 --> 00:18:20.790
These tomatas were procured from Lurugus.

00:18:20.790 --> 00:18:23.830
Apparently, they use an
unusual fertilizer in Lurugus, so...

00:18:24.080 --> 00:18:26.000
that's why they're delicious...

00:18:29.130 --> 00:18:30.630
What was that about?

00:18:31.130 --> 00:18:33.380
Oh, Al-kun, good morning.

00:18:33.540 --> 00:18:35.210
You're early today.

00:18:35.210 --> 00:18:36.000
Helen-san!

00:18:36.920 --> 00:18:38.920
Please allow me to return to my parents' home!

00:18:38.920 --> 00:18:41.210
Huh?! What?! What's wrong, Al-kun?!

00:18:41.210 --> 00:18:43.130
You want to quit the guild?!
You don't like the guild?!

00:18:43.130 --> 00:18:44.040
Or is it me?!

00:18:44.040 --> 00:18:46.460
Oh, was it because Luke was teasing you
the other day at the drinking party?!

00:18:46.460 --> 00:18:48.210
We'll apologize if you have a gripe
about something!

00:18:48.210 --> 00:18:49.250
Or is it me?!

00:18:49.250 --> 00:18:51.170
No, no! That's not what I meant!

00:18:51.170 --> 00:18:54.920
Actually, my parents migrated to Lurugus.

00:18:54.920 --> 00:18:57.250
And there's apparently a good fertilizer there,

00:18:57.250 --> 00:19:01.170
so while I'm going to go buy that,
I thought I'd go see them for the first time in a while.

00:19:01.170 --> 00:19:04.710
Oh, so that's why... I thought for sure, it was...

00:19:04.710 --> 00:19:06.630
So, I'd like to consult with you.

00:19:06.630 --> 00:19:11.790
Is it possible for you to allocate the quests
that I undertook to other people?

00:19:12.080 --> 00:19:13.460
Let's see...

00:19:13.830 --> 00:19:16.330
Oh, if it's this, then I'll take it on.

00:19:16.540 --> 00:19:18.380
What? You, Helen-san?

00:19:18.630 --> 00:19:20.880
But that's monster suppression...

00:19:22.330 --> 00:19:24.210
Actually, in addition to reception duties,

00:19:24.210 --> 00:19:27.710
I've been undertaking suppression quests
about two or three times a week.

00:19:27.920 --> 00:19:30.880
What?! F-rank?! When did that happen?

00:19:30.880 --> 00:19:36.670
Once I was able to handle Ouroboros' powers,
I started to actually enjoy suppressions, so...

00:19:36.670 --> 00:19:38.460
So, you've awakened to that, I see...

00:19:38.790 --> 00:19:40.540
So, given that...

00:19:40.880 --> 00:19:43.960
Al-kun, go ahead and visit your parents' home.

00:19:44.710 --> 00:19:48.000
Uh, I'm kind of worried in another sense, but...

00:19:48.210 --> 00:19:50.330
Oh, well. I guess I should hurry and depart-

00:19:50.330 --> 00:19:51.130
Al-kun!

00:19:51.750 --> 00:19:52.670
Fal!

00:19:52.670 --> 00:19:53.830
I made it in time!

00:19:53.830 --> 00:19:55.210
You're going on a quest, right?

00:19:55.210 --> 00:19:57.670
I'm going to accompany you, okay?

00:19:57.830 --> 00:20:02.710
Naturally, I can't register with the guild,
but I can accompany you,

00:20:02.710 --> 00:20:04.670
and I want to raise my rank bit by bit too.

00:20:04.670 --> 00:20:06.830
Oh, the thing is...

00:20:08.630 --> 00:20:11.170
What?! Returning to your parents' home?!

00:20:11.170 --> 00:20:12.250
That's right.

00:20:12.250 --> 00:20:14.380
That's why, for this time, I'll just go by myself-

00:20:14.380 --> 00:20:16.460
Well then, all the more reason to go together!

00:20:16.460 --> 00:20:18.380
Like, to greet your parents and stuff.

00:20:18.380 --> 00:20:21.290
Oh, no, no! Stuff like that isn't necessary!

00:20:21.290 --> 00:20:24.040
But you will make sure to come back, right?

00:20:24.250 --> 00:20:25.290
Of course!

00:20:25.290 --> 00:20:28.630
You know, I also have the fields,
so I can't leave them for too long.

00:20:28.630 --> 00:20:31.040
I see... Then I guess that's okay...

00:20:31.040 --> 00:20:32.540
So, can I go with you?

00:20:32.540 --> 00:20:34.330
No, not this time...

00:20:34.330 --> 00:20:35.670
You're right.

00:20:35.670 --> 00:20:38.210
You're going to go see
your parents in particular, so...

00:20:38.540 --> 00:20:40.330
So, is it okay if I go with...

00:20:40.330 --> 00:20:42.580
And, he ran away...

00:20:44.880 --> 00:20:46.210
I'm at a loss...

00:20:46.540 --> 00:20:49.210
Why does she try to come along
with me all the time?

00:20:49.580 --> 00:20:52.500
Once I arrive in Lurugus,
I'll search for the fertilizer for the tomatas.

00:20:52.500 --> 00:20:56.460
I'm excited that I get to cultivate tomatas
that are that delicious!

00:20:56.460 --> 00:21:01.210
It's been nothing but troublesome events lately,
like monsters and Ouroboros and such, so...

00:21:01.210 --> 00:21:02.790
After all, I am a farmer-

00:21:03.500 --> 00:21:05.210
Huh?! This feeling...

00:21:07.170 --> 00:21:08.710
An orc!

00:21:14.210 --> 00:21:16.750
A sign of friendship?

00:21:16.750 --> 00:21:17.830
I see.

00:21:17.830 --> 00:21:22.250
He may be an orc, but he's a male,
so does he want to become friends with me?

00:21:24.960 --> 00:21:26.500
Wanna do it?

00:21:26.500 --> 00:21:27.420
Huh?

00:21:27.790 --> 00:21:29.250
That's what you meant?!

00:21:30.790 --> 00:21:33.670
Hey! Hang on! You see, I'm in a hurry!

00:21:35.000 --> 00:21:37.500
Stop, stop, stop stop! Stop! Stop!

00:21:37.500 --> 00:21:39.540
Your breath stinks! Don't move!

00:21:39.540 --> 00:21:40.710
Don't push against me!

00:21:40.710 --> 00:21:43.250
No! I don't like orcs!

00:21:48.380 --> 00:21:49.250
What?!

00:21:49.920 --> 00:21:50.920
Oomph!

00:21:51.670 --> 00:21:54.130
You okay?

00:23:30.080 --> 00:23:41.000
<b>Episode 5</b>

00:23:30.080 --> 00:23:41.000
<b>The Farmer and Lurugus</b>
